_struct_biol.id                    1 
_struct_biol.details               
;THE TWO FAB' HEAVY CHAINS (RESIDUES 1-227) OF THE
ASYMMETRIC UNIT HAVE BEEN ASSIGNED CHAIN INDICATORS *H*
AND *J*.

THERE ARE TWO FAB MOLECULES PER ASYMMETRIC UNIT.
THE NON-CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC TRANSFORMATION PRESENTED ON THE
*MTRIX* RECORDS BELOW YIELDS APPROXIMATE COORDINATES FOR
MOLECULE 2 WHEN APPLIED TO MOLECULE 1 (COORDINATES OF
CHAIN *M* FROM CHAIN *L* AND COORDINATES OF CHAIN *J* FROM
CHAIN *H*).
;
